              "style": {
                "classes": "exchange/event-streams/subtitle"
              },
              "text": "Welcome to the Event Stream Exchange Resource, this resource will give you an example of how to use each Source and Handler. Each \"source-xxxx-xxxx\" event stream resource will log a message to the gateway logs. The \"handler-all\" will stream a tag event change to all handler types."
